.conversion/*.tmp

# media: 1.1 GB, moved out of public/ into legacy-public/ (not published, decision d52); was copied into public/ by npm run assets:copy from .conversion/media-cache, never committed (decision d21)
/legacy-public/wp-content/uploads/
/.conversion/video-download/
/public/_redirects
